  "description": ".NET for Android bindings for the Salesforce Marketing Cloud MobilePush module (com.salesforce.marketingcloud:marketingcloudsdk) - push registration, inbox, in-app messages, geofence and beacon messaging - plus the modular feature .aars of the Unified SDK architecture. Successor to the sfmc-net-bindings-mobile packages, at the v11 generation.",
